1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,200
Before I start working, I want proof the client actually committed the money.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:09,000
The agreement is addressed to my wallet, the amount is fixed, and payment is tied to the milestone.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,800
I've finished the work, so I submit the milestone instead of asking the client to manually send me money.

4
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:22,500
Submitting does not automatically pay me. The client still has to review the milestone.

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:30,000
After the client approves, the escrow releases the payment to my wallet. Payment follows the agreement state instead of relying on a promise.
